Cell[TextData[{
 "1: ",
 StyleBox["After",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " evaluation, how many digits of numerical accuracy do each of the following \
expressions have?\n\t\[GrayCircle] 3/7\n\t\[GrayCircle] 2+3/7\n\t\
\[GrayCircle] 2.0+3.0/7.0\t\t(Hint: You can use   InputForm[2.0 + 3.0/7.0]   \
to see all digits.)\n\t\[GrayCircle] 1.23+1.2345/1.234567   (See the Hint.)\n\
\t\[GrayCircle] 1.2+1.2345678901234567890+1.23456789012345678901234567890\n\t\
\[GrayCircle] 1.2345678901234567890+1.23456789012345678901234567890\n\t\
\[GrayCircle] N[2/7]   (See the Hint.)\n\t\[GrayCircle] N[2/7,100]\n\t\
\[GrayCircle] After evaluation, why does ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " leave ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c74d6d98-1b10-418b-ab35-35a9cc1d0e17"],
 " as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9cfa9ffb-53b3-49a2-8c52-38f98b641e7b"],
 " and not as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SqrtBox["2"], " ", "\[Rule]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "078a95eb-cd07-4413-8a6e-3ace5e6621aa"],
 " 1.4142135623730951"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3901682233866*^9, 3.3901683123806*^9}, {
